    "unidentifiedDesc": "<p><span style=\"font-family: DDG_ProximaNova, DDG_ProximaNova_UI_0, DDG_ProximaNova_UI_1, DDG_ProximaNova_UI_2, DDG_ProximaNova_UI_3, DDG_ProximaNova_UI_4, DDG_ProximaNova_UI_5, DDG_ProximaNova_UI_6, 'Proxima Nova', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, 'Noto Sans', sans-serif\">This staff has a sturdy, polished appearance, made from a rich, dark wood. The top is adorned with a beautifully carved symbol of healing, surrounded by intricate designs that evoke a sense of divine power.</span></p>",
